  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-frp",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness plugin for **frps** (server) and **frpc** (client)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Safety",
      "text": "- If `/etc/frp/frps.toml` already exists, `frp.install_server` **adopts** it and does **not** rewrite token or port ranges.\n- Client configs live in `~/.config/dsh-frp/` with proxy names prefixed `dsh-frp-`, so other tunnels are untouched.\n- Secrets come from environment / `~/.env` (`FRP_TOKEN`, dashboard password). Never committed."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add ./dsh-frp"
    },
    {
      "section": "or",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:tingaidehua/dsh-frp\n```\n\nTested against `@deepseek-ai/dsh@0.2.1-alpha.2`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Vendor binaries",
      "text": "`vendor/linux/amd64/{frps,frpc}` and `vendor/windows/amd64/{frps.exe,frpc.exe}` (frp 0.71.0)."
    }
  ],
